H("888.d.14.C",4,"An exhaust heat exchanger poses a danger because a crack can allow:","carbon monoxide to enter the cabin",["cool air","more oxygen","extra lift"],"CO hazard.")
H("888.d.14.D",3,"A student compares the compressor, condenser and evaporator of a vapor-cycle system with the turbine and heat exchanger of an air-cycle system. She is:","differentiating between vapor-cycle and air-cycle system components and functions",["comparing wheels","comparing seats","comparing lights"],"Cooling systems.")
