H("888.d.14.F",4,"A chemical oxygen generator produces oxygen through:","a chemical reaction when activated",["a compressor","a fan","a filter"],"Chemical oxygen.")
H("888.d.14.G",3,"A mechanic identifies the oxygen cylinder, regulator, mask and hoses as parts of the system. She is:","differentiating between types of aircraft oxygen system components",["identifying engines","identifying seats","identifying lights"],"Oxygen parts.")
H("888.d.14.G",4,"A regulator in an oxygen system:","reduces cylinder pressure to a usable level",["adds pressure","cools the cylinder","stores fuel"],"Oxygen regulator.")
