H("888.d.14.I",4,"Releasing refrigerant to the air is prohibited because it can:","harm the environment and cause injury",["clean the air","cool the hangar","improve safety"],"Refrigerant release.")
H("888.d.14.J",3,"A technician secures gas cylinders upright with chains and caps the valves when moving them. She is:","assessing risks associated with storage, handling and use of compressed gases",["ignoring cylinders","dropping cylinders","hiding cylinders"],"Cylinder safety.")
H("888.d.14.J",4,"A compressed gas cylinder should be transported with:","its valve cap on",["its valve exposed","no cap","a loose cap"],"Valve cap.")
